<title>RUSSIA: Russian April inflation 1.0 pct vs 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian April inflation 1.0 pct vs 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's monthly consumer price inflation slowed in April to 1.0 percent, its lowest rate since September last year, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    APR 97    MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +1.0	+1.4	+2.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    N/A     +16.7     +68.3</p>
<p>Inflation averaged 0.032 percent a day in April after 0.046 percent in March.</p>
<p>Prices have risen 6.4 percent so far this year.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
